@startuml
title Selected Architecture A - expense submission and atomic final approval
actor "Member / reviewer" as Actor
participant "Swing presenter\nbackground worker" as UI
participant "Application services" as APP
participant "Domain rules" as DOMAIN
database "Local SQLite\nUnitOfWork adapter" as DB
Actor -> UI : Submit expense
UI -> APP : actor + details + operation key
APP -> DB : begin write; lookup/claim key
alt same key and same fingerprint already committed
  DB --> APP : original expense/result
  APP -> DB : end transaction without additional writes
else new submission
  APP -> DB : load current membership and policy
  APP -> DOMAIN : validate / allocate / snapshot policy
  alt invalid or unresolved affected policy
    APP -> DB : rollback
    APP --> UI : explicit error / policy gate
  else valid
    APP -> DB : insert PENDING expense, shares, audit, operation result
    APP -> DB : commit (no balance postings)
  end
end
APP --> UI : submitted result
UI --> Actor : display on EDT
Actor -> UI : Approve or reject
UI -> APP : actor + expense/version + decision + operation key
APP -> DB : begin write; deduplicate; load state/role/policy
APP -> DOMAIN : authorize reviewer and validate transition
alt unauthorized / stale / terminal conflict
  APP -> DB : rollback; return explicit error
else previously completed matching operation
  APP -> DB : end transaction without additional writes
  APP --> UI : original result
else valid new decision
  APP -> DB : insert immutable decision
  alt rejection
    APP -> DB : set REJECTED; no postings
  else approvals incomplete (future multi-step)
    APP -> DB : retain PENDING; no postings
  else fully approved
    APP -> DOMAIN : create positive non-payer share postings
    DOMAIN --> APP : participant -> expense payer
    APP -> DB : set APPROVED; insert all uniquely keyed postings
  end
  alt any write fails
    APP -> DB : rollback decision/status/postings/audit/key result
  else all writes valid
    APP -> DB : save audit + operation result; commit
  end
end
APP --> UI : result / failure
UI --> Actor : display on EDT
note over APP, DB
One local SQLite transaction for final approval + postings.
BEGIN IMMEDIATE is proposed; driver protocol must be tested.
Same key with changed payload is a conflict.
No postings for pending/rejected/zero shares.
Single-step pilot; multi-step, notifications and reports deferred.
end note
@enduml
